==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nn|liggje}}
* {{nn-inf|ligg}}

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|nn|legʰ}}
From {{inh|nn|non|liggja}}, from {{inh|nn|gem-pro|*ligjaną}}, from {{der|nn|ine-pro|*legʰ-}}. Akin to {{cog|en|lie}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|no|/²lɪjːɑ/}}

===Verb===
{{nn-verb-irreg|ligg|låg|lege}} {{catlangname|nn|strong verbs|class 5 strong verbs}}

# to [[lie]] (to be in a horizontal position.)
#: ''Kvifor '''ligg''' du her?''
#:: Why are you '''lying''' here?
# to [[lie]] (location), be [[located]]
#: {{usex|nn|Kvar '''ligg''' kjøpesenteret?|Where is the shopping centre '''located'''?}}

